{"id":"MOEX-112100-2301-Q053","title":"Doxorubicin：拓撲異構酶II與心臟毒性","version":"integration-v2 after accepted tone/teaching patches","batch":"112-2-med2-q51-100","sourceSha256":"c5de8c0e3af4773e0acd1361654bb14a217102f090c6e3e4dddfcffab1615597","shortHtml":"<p><strong>選B。</strong>Doxorubicin是蒽環類抗腫瘤抗生素，來自鏈黴菌的天然產物。它可嵌入去氧核糖核酸（DNA）鹼基對之間，並<strong>穩定拓撲異構酶II與已切開DNA形成的複合體</strong>，妨礙斷裂後的重新接合。原選項把標的寫成topoisomerase I，因而錯誤。</p>","html":"<h2>Doxorubicin：拓撲異構酶II與心臟毒性</h2><p class=\"reviewed-official-answer\">官方最終採計：B</p><h3>把I改成II，才是doxorubicin的關鍵標的</h3>\n\n<p><strong>選B。</strong>Doxorubicin是蒽環類抗腫瘤抗生素，來自鏈黴菌的天然產物。它可嵌入去氧核糖核酸（DNA）鹼基對之間，並<strong>穩定拓撲異構酶II與已切開DNA形成的複合體</strong>，妨礙斷裂後的重新接合。原選項把標的寫成topoisomerase I，因而錯誤。</p>\n\n<h3>先理解酵素原本在做什麼</h3>\n\n<p>DNA在複製與轉錄時會產生纏繞、超螺旋等問題。拓撲異構酶II會暫時切開一段DNA的<strong>雙股</strong>，讓另一段雙股DNA穿過，再把缺口接回去。正常情況下，「切開」與「接回」是同一個循環；doxorubicin使已切開的酵素—DNA複合體累積，讓本來可逆的步驟轉成細胞傷害。</p>\n\n<h3>I與II常成對出題</h3>\n\n<div class=\"reviewed-table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>標的</th><th>正常切割方式</th><th>常考藥物</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td>拓撲異構酶I</td><td>暫時切開DNA單股，解除扭轉壓力</td><td>Irinotecan、topotecan</td></tr>\n<tr><td>拓撲異構酶II</td><td>暫時切開DNA雙股，進行片段穿越與解纏</td><td>Doxorubicin、etoposide</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n\n<figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:3341px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.166550279329609\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/4c6861eee126412815c5890da93ab40727919a60386303d6485ed6cbea6d8a87.png\" alt=\"Kcneuman既有拓撲異構酶II催化循環圖，示切開G片段、T片段通過及重新接合\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"3341\" height=\"2864\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/4c6861eee126412815c5890da93ab40727919a60386303d6485ed6cbea6d8a87.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption>沿箭頭看第2步<strong>cleavage（切開）</strong>與第3步<strong>ligation（接合）</strong>，即可理解「妨礙接回」為何造成傷害。G-segment是被切開的門控DNA片段，T-segment是穿過的DNA片段。圖呈現酵素的正常催化循環。ATP為三磷酸腺苷、ADP為二磷酸腺苷、P<sub>i</sub>為無機磷酸。Kcneuman，<em>Type II topoisomerase catalytic cycle</em>，<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>，原圖未改。</figcaption></figure>\n\n<h3>其餘選項與心臟毒性的連結</h3>\n\n<p><strong>A正確：</strong>「抗生素」在此描述其天然來源與分類，臨床用途為抗腫瘤。<strong>C正確：</strong>doxorubicin相關自由基與氧化傷害可參與心臟毒性。<strong>D正確：</strong>傳統藥理分類列為細胞週期非專一性藥物，可在多個週期階段發揮作用。</p>\n\n<p>延伸判讀：蒽環類心肌病變與<strong>累積暴露</strong>相關，藥品仿單因此重視治療前及治療期間的心臟功能評估。下一題的bleomycin則以肺部毒性為重要警訊。兩藥可依主要器官毒性作比較。</p>\n\n<details><summary>原題、答鍵與圖文查核來源</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=112100&amp;q=1&amp;s=22&amp;t=Q\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部正式原題（卷碼2301）</a></li><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=112100&amp;q=1&amp;s=22&amp;t=S\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部標準答案</a></li><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=112100&amp;q=1&amp;s=22&amp;t=M\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">本科最後更正：Q69最終一律給分；其餘依更正答鍵</a></li><li><a href=\"https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=1fd148fb-0fbc-4b6f-b790-23546fb46a71\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">DailyMed doxorubicin正式仿單：來源、12.1作用機轉、自由基及累積心臟毒性</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.cancer.gov/publications/dictionaries/cancer-drug/def/doxorubicin-hydrochloride\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">美國國家癌症研究所（NCI）藥物詞典：嵌入DNA、topoisomerase II與自由基</a></li><li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Type_II_topoisomerase_catalytic_cycle.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Kcneuman原圖：雙股切割／穿越／接合循環及CC BY-SA 4.0授權</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.cancer.gov/publications/dictionaries/cancer-drug/def/irinotecan-hydrochloride\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NCI：irinotecan／活性SN-38的topoisomerase I標的</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.cancer.gov/publications/dictionaries/cancer-drug/def/topotecan-hydrochloride\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NCI：topotecan抑制topoisomerase I接合</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.cancer.gov/publications/dictionaries/cancer-drug/def/etoposide\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NCI：etoposide的topoisomerase II標的</a></li></ul></details>","imageCount":1,"sourceAnswer":"官方最終採計：B"}